{
  "uid": "jp-dev-p09-apis",
  "title": "JP Dev P09 API Operations",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "tags": [
    "japanese-learning",
    "P09",
    "development"
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "API operations",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/jp-dev-p09-apis",
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "title": "Telemetry and capacity",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/jp-dev-p09-telemetry",
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "title": "Log search",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5601/app/discover#/?_a=(index:application-logs)",
      "targetBlank": true
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Service (shared API panels)",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "user-api,vocabulary-api",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": "user-api|vocabulary-api",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Scrape availability (not application readiness)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "One means scrape succeeded; zero failed. Missing series is UNKNOWN. JWKS has no scrape job. Window: current gauge, displayed over selected time range. Gaps/NaN mean unknown; no zero fill.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "jp-dev-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by(job)(up{job=~\"${service:regex}\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "UNKNOWN / no series",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "HTTP throughput / 5m",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "HTTP completed requests; bounded job aggregation. Window: 5m rolling rate. Gaps/NaN mean unknown; no zero fill.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "jp-dev-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(job)(rate(http_requests_received_total{job=~\"${service:regex}\"}[5m])) or sum by(job)(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=~\"${service:regex}\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "noValue": "UNKNOWN / no series",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "HTTP 5xx fraction / 5m",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Absent error counters or no traffic give UNKNOWN, not a fabricated zero. Window: 5m rolling rate. Gaps/NaN mean unknown; no zero fill.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "jp-dev-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(job)(rate(http_requests_received_total{job=~\"${service:regex}\",code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / sum by(job)(rate(http_requests_received_total{job=~\"${service:regex}\"}[5m])) or sum by(job)(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=~\"${service:regex}\",status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / sum by(job)(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=~\"${service:regex}\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "UNKNOWN / no series",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "HTTP p95 / 5m",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Histogram estimate in seconds. No observations gives a gap. Window: 5m rolling rate. Gaps/NaN mean unknown; no zero fill.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "jp-dev-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95,sum by(job,le)(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=~\"${service:regex}\"}[5m]))) or histogram_quantile(0.95,sum by(job,le)(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{job=~\"${service:regex}\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "UNKNOWN / no series",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Managed / JVM heap memory",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Heap only; excludes native memory. Window: current gauge, displayed over selected time range. Gaps/NaN mean unknown; no zero fill.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "jp-dev-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(job)(dotnet_total_memory_bytes{job=~\"${service:regex}\"}) or sum by(job)(jvm_memory_used_bytes{job=~\"${service:regex}\",area=\"heap\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "noValue": "UNKNOWN / no series",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "User API CPU / 5m",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Core-seconds per second; two cores are 2. Service selector does not apply to this service-specific panel. Window: 5m rolling rate. Gaps/NaN mean unknown; no zero fill.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "jp-dev-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(job)(rate(process_cpu_seconds_total{job=\"user-api\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "UNKNOWN / no series",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Vocabulary process CPU fraction",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Native JVM fraction; not a measured cgroup saturation ratio. Service-specific panel. Window: current gauge, displayed over selected time range. Gaps/NaN mean unknown; no zero fill.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "jp-dev-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by(job)(process_cpu_usage{job=\"vocabulary-api\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "UNKNOWN / no series",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "SQL Server client pool connections",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Client active/idle/pooled; no database-server health claim. Service-specific panel. Window: current gauge, displayed over selected time range. Gaps/NaN mean unknown; no zero fill.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "jp-dev-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(state)(app_database_pool_connections{job=\"user-api\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{state}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "UNKNOWN / no series",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Vocabulary pool queue",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Queued acquisitions; not all database operations. Service-specific panel. Window: current gauge, displayed over selected time range. Gaps/NaN mean unknown; no zero fill.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "jp-dev-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(sql_pool_queue_size{job=\"vocabulary-api\"})",
          "legendFormat": "Vocabulary pool queue",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "UNKNOWN / no series",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Vocabulary pool utilization",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Native default reactive-pool ratio. Service-specific panel. Window: current gauge, displayed over selected time range. Gaps/NaN mean unknown; no zero fill.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "jp-dev-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(sql_pool_ratio{job=\"vocabulary-api\"})",
          "legendFormat": "Vocabulary pool utilization",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "UNKNOWN / no series",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "title": "Incident navigation and signal gaps",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Environment: development / jp_learning_dev (fixed datasource; no environment label exists).\n\n[OpenSearch Discover](http://127.0.0.1:5601/app/discover#/?_a=(index:application-logs)) · [Tempo Explore](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22%3A%22jp-dev-tempo%22%7D) · [Prometheus alerts](http://127.0.0.1:9091/alerts)\n\nRunbook: observability/roadmap/p09-incident-runbooks.md. Owners: jp-operations (telemetry/capacity), jp-application (API/database), jp-security (access/JWKS).\n\nJWKS metrics, DB-server health, direct Fluent Bit/OTel/Tempo/OpenSearch metrics are **unavailable**. Tempo/Grafana storage measurements may be missing. Use authenticated health checks from the runbook. No missing signal is a healthy zero.\n\nSearch logs by bounded service/environment/time first. Only validated nonzero 32-hex `trace_id` values identify OTel traces. `correlation_id` and legacy X-Trace-Id are independent; unsampled/missing traces are expected. Never place credentials or personal identifiers into URLs."
      }
    }
  ]
}
